# Files cc-doctrine injects at SessionStart and after every compaction.
# One path per line, relative to this repo unless absolute. Paid on every session
# AND after every compaction — keep it short.
#
# Almost nothing belongs here. Every CLAUDE_*.md, VOICE.md, PROSE.md, NONDUAL.md,
# VERIFY.md, HARNESS.md, EDITING.md, MODEL.md, DISPATCH.md and
# negative-space-expanded.md in this repo is a REJECTED DRAFT of CLAUDE.md. They
# are the graveyard. Do not wire them, however binding their own headings claim to
# be — a rejected rule that reaches a session outranks a live one that does not.
#
# The live doctrine is CLAUDE.md, kept deliberately small: only what can be
# justified as a preference over the model's default behaviour. A rule that
# survives goes there, not here.
#
# This file exists for the one case CLAUDE.md cannot cover — a rule whose body
# lives somewhere else and which an "invoke X" line fails to load. Measured with
# cc-rule-audit: `/i-have-adhd` in CLAUDE.md fired in 9 of 637 sessions, because a
# slash command in an injected file is text, not an invocation.

/home/midori/i-have-adhd/skills/i-have-adhd/SKILL.md    # 1302 tok
